## 1. Ownership

The AWSM Strategy Tool (codename: Draper or Arlon's Brain), including its system prompt, skill chain, reference library, frameworks, annotations, and all associated materials contained in this repository, is the sole intellectual property of Arlon Mwangi. All rights are reserved.

